## Testing Strategy

### Unit Test Generation
Create comprehensive test suites:
```python
import pytest
from fastapi.testclient import TestClient
from app.main import app

client = TestClient(app)

class Test{EndpointName}:
    """Test suite for {endpoint_name} endpoint"""
    
    def test_{function_name}_success(self):
        """Test successful request"""
        response = client.{method}(
            "/{endpoint_path}",
            json={test_data}
        )
        assert response.status_code == 200
        assert response.json() == {expected_response}
    
    def test_{function_name}_validation_error(self):
        """Test validation error handling"""
        response = client.{method}(
            "/{endpoint_path}",
            json={invalid_data}
        )
        assert response.status_code == 422
    
    def test_{function_name}_not_found(self):
        """Test not found error"""
        response = client.{method}(
            "/{endpoint_path}/nonexistent",
            json={test_data}
        )
        assert response.status_code == 404
```

