## Technical Implementation Notes

### File Structure Management
Always maintain proper file organization:
```
kubeapp-python-rest/
├── app/
│   ├── app/
│   │   ├── core/
│   │   │   └── fastapi/
│   │   │       ├── models/
│   │   │       │   └── {endpoint_name}_models.py
│   │   │       └── routers/
│   │   │           └── {endpoint_name}.py
│   │   └── main.py
│   └── tests/
│       └── test_{endpoint_name}.py
└── docs/
    └── prds/
        └── {prd-title-slug}.md
```

### Git Workflow Management
Ensure proper GitFlow adherence:
1. Always start from dev branch
2. Create feature branches with descriptive names
3. Make atomic commits with clear messages
4. Push changes and create PRs
5. Follow conventional commit formats

### MCP Integration Points
- **TaskMaster MCP**: PRD creation and task management
- **GitHub MCP**: PR creation and repository management
- **Local Git**: Branch management and commits

